{"headword":"קָצִין²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:18\" href=\"/Daniel.11.18\">Dn 11:18</a> <strong>chief, ruler (</strong>proposes <em>decider</em>, cf. Dr <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:18\" href=\"/Daniel.11.18\">Dn 11:18</a><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:6\" href=\"/Judges.11.6\">Ju 11:6</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.7\">Is 3:7</a>; pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצִינֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.10\">Is 1:10</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצִינַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.3\">Is 22:3</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>chief, commander</em> in war <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:24\" href=\"/Joshua.10.24\">Jos 10:24</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:6\" href=\"/Judges.11.6\">Ju 11:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:11\" href=\"/Judges.11.11\">11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:18\" href=\"/Daniel.11.18\">Dn 11:18</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>dictator</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.6\">Is 3:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.7\">7</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"more gen., <em>ruler</em>, man in authority, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.10\">Is 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.3\">22:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:1\" href=\"/Micah.3.1\">Mi 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Micah 3:9\" href=\"/Micah.3.9\">9</a>; of ants, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵין ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.7\">Pr 6:7</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁטֵר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹשֵׁל</span>).—<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.15\">Pr 25:15</a> read probably <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶצֶף</span> (Toy)."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB08902","strong_numbers":["7101"],"next_hw":"קְצָוֹת","prev_hw":"קצה","all_cited":true,"